      "663U-1",
      "Calculation icon, duration result or scenario price effect.",
      "1 bp converts to 0.0001. Invalid input clears the calculated output and identifies the field. All-in corporate yield cannot be combined with a separate spread shock. Mathematical sensitivity is never labeled expected return."
