      "Growth, substitution, safety demand and funding squeeze remain distinct. A Treasury price response does not fill a missing buyer-allocation link. Dashed edges carry no flow volume or causal proof."
    ],
    [
      "I04",
      "Case monitor composer",
      "665W-1",
      "Review conditions / next test",
      "Fresh valid invalidation outranks confirmation. Unknown critical evidence blocks confirmation. The fifth eligible close is evaluated before expiry. Pauses do not extend the window silently. Late data cannot silently reopen or backdate a terminal outcome. Duplicate saves have one canonical effect."
